    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d914">

                <pb facs="1049" n="855" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg855"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.65/7–2345: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 914<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Representative on the Allied
                        Commission on Reparations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Pauley</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Washington Liaison Officer for the Delegation to
                        the Allied Commission on Reparations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kindleberger</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d914-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-23">July 23, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Victory</hi> 235. To [Acting] Secretary of State for
                    Kindleberger, Washington, from Pauley.</p>
                <p>Please cable the following information in so far as it is available at once: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Estimate of approximate value of manufacturing and agricultural
                            resources in (<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) East Prussia and (<hi
                                rendition="#italic">b</hi>) that portion of East Prussia <pb
                                facs="1050" n="856" xml:id="pg856"/> north of an east-west line
                            passing through Goldap and Braunsberg, which line is approximately 33
                            kilometers south of Koenigsberg.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Estimated annual value of industrial output for each of these
                            areas.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Estimated annual value of agricultural output for each of these
                            areas.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d914-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d914-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the Acting Secretary of State. The same message was sent as <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Confrep</hi> 8 to the United States Military
                    Mission, Moscow, marked “For Sproul for Bergson and Abramovitz from Pauley”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
